      <iframe src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/1QkJkMUuDEE" title="Brain Puzzle 3 Level 71 walkthrough video" loading="lazy" allowfullscreen></iframe>
    </div>
    <InContentAd />

    <h2>Level 71 walkthrough: every move in order<span class="accent">.</span></h2>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Steps 1–3</span>
      <strong>Drag money (then 2 more)</strong>
      <p>Drag money to the floor/wall. Drag money to the girl's clothes. Drag money to the bag.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Steps 4–6</span>
      <strong>Tap (then 2 more)</strong>
      <p>Tap to open the bag. Drag money to the phone. Drag money to the bike outside the door.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Steps 7–9</span>
      <strong>Drag money (then 2 more)</strong>
      <p>Drag money to the shoes. Drag money to the girl's dry hair. Drag money to the dog outside the door.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Steps 10–12</span>
      <strong>Drag money (then 2 more)</strong>
      <p>Drag money to the vase. Drag perfume to the girl. Drag money to the face.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Steps 13–14</span>
      <strong>Drag money (then 1 more)</strong>
      <p>Drag money to the gravel on the bed. Drag the gem to the girl.</p>
    </div>

    <h2>If your level 71 shows “Champion Photo”<span class="accent">.</span></h2>
    <p>Brain Puzzle 3 does not hand every player the same scene at the same number: builds and
    install order differ, and both variants are on record. If the banner on your screen reads
    “Help them get in position before taking photos”, this is that scene, 9 moves in order:</p>
    <ol class="alt-steps">
        <li>Tap the coach’s head.</li>
        <li>Swipe right on the head of the player on the left.</li>
        <li>Tap the referee's money-counting hand.</li>
        <li>Swipe left on the face of the player on the right.</li>
        <li>Drag the chocolate from the ad to the trophy.</li>
        <li>Tap the big screen.</li>
        <li>Tap the censored middle finger of the player on the right.</li>
        <li>Drag the paint to the banner.</li>
        <li>Drag the gold medal from the coach's neck to the middle player.</li>
    </ol>

